psensor-fork (1.4.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * You can now easily customize the display order of your sensors!
  * Simply open the Sensor Preferences window and drag any sensor up
  * or down to reposition it. The changes take effect immediately and
  * the new order will be reflected in the main sensor list (the one
  * shown next to the graph). Your custom order is saved automatically
  * and persists across sessions

 -- thuongshoo <yuyoonshoo@gmail.com>  Tue, 28 Jun 2026 10:30:00 +0000

